5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know exactly who pays for what so nobody gets stuck with extra bills.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need the total weekly cost upfront. Surprise charges are unacceptable for me.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am curious how the room layout affects our time together versus alone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to see how many hours are lost to travel and setup.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about where I can wash and sit without using the bed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if we split the bill evenly, does that cover all the little extras?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,Only if the quote is all-inclusive. I refuse to guess at hidden fees.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, do you think a longer trip means less time for us to talk?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
