35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found that buying meals separately means the light eater pays less, but the whole-house bill splits evenly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The offshore houses are 5,400 yen a head a night, but food is extra. That is a variable I cannot ignore.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,I found that last year we barely spoke because we drifted apart. I want a place that keeps us together.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry takes two days to cross. That is a third of the week gone before we even start.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I found the island houses have one bathroom for everyone. I cannot sleep if I have to wait for a bath.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if we rent the whole house, the food cost is just a shared pot, right?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, but I need to know the total before we book. I will not pay for someone else's appetite.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, two days of travel is too much. I want us to be together, not on a boat.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The train to the valley is ninety minutes. That is manageable. The ferry is not.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,The inn has a door. I can close it. That is what I need.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"I think the valley inn is better. The travel is short, and the bill is clear.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The offshore option has too many unknowns. The valley inn has a fixed rate.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I like the valley. It is close enough that we can walk to the bath together, but far enough to rest.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The train is reliable. I can sleep on it. The ferry is not. I will not waste my rest.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The inn has a chair. I can sit. I can wash. I can sleep.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I am happy with the valley inn. The money is clear, and the travel is short.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I am satisfied. The cost is predictable, and the logistics are simple. I will not be surprised.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I feel this is the right balance. We will be together, but we will have space to breathe.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I accept this. The overhead is low. I can arrive and rest. That is all I need.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am relieved. I can close the door. I can wash. I can sit. I can sleep.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
